# One Oxylabs ISP proxy endpoint per line: host:port  (one per VM).
# Copy to proxies.txt (gitignored) and paste your endpoints from the Oxylabs
# dashboard. Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Example (your real host/ports will differ):
# isp.oxylabs.io:8001
# isp.oxylabs.io:8002
# isp.oxylabs.io:8003
